# Hero motion

Do not change the hero layout, copy, colors, spacing, or controls. Animation must finish on the current design.

- Motion fades and lifts existing text, portrait, buttons, and hire actions.
- Anime.js draws the existing teal caption rule and counts the existing year stats.
- Leave hover styles on the buttons as they are.
- Do not add sections, icons, or background effects.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — restyles the heading while adding motion
<motion.h1 className="text-center text-6xl text-primary" />

// ✅ GOOD — same classes, entrance only
<motion.h1
  className="mt-5 font-sans text-[clamp(2.7rem,4.5vw,4.35rem)] font-extrabold leading-[0.96] tracking-[-0.035em] text-white"
  initial={{ opacity: 0, y: 18 }}
  animate={{ opacity: 1, y: 0 }}
/>
```
